{"id": "definition:lex-0090:sense:01", "kind": "definition", "source": {"categories": ["Sexism"], "entry_id": "lex-0090", "lexicon_sha256": "31240193eeba29f712560e2e80e89ee9dd5c3c969aa180d10b95bf2451882385", "sense_id": "lex-0090:sense:01", "term": "女拳", "text": "'女拳'是'女权'的中文谐音，常用于对中国女权主义者的贬义表达。"}}
{"id": "definition:lex-0117:sense:01", "kind": "definition", "source": {"categories": ["Region"], "entry_id": "lex-0117", "lexicon_sha256": "31240193eeba29f712560e2e80e89ee9dd5c3c969aa180d10b95bf2451882385", "sense_id": "lex-0117:sense:01", "term": "地域黑", "text": "即地域歧视，是由于认知群体对某一地区的认知性偏差所造成的刻板印象导致的社会行为。"}}
{"id": "definition:lex-0327:sense:01", "kind": "definition", "source": {"categories": ["others"], "entry_id": "lex-0327", "lexicon_sha256": "31240193eeba29f712560e2e80e89ee9dd5c3c969aa180d10b95bf2451882385", "sense_id": "lex-0327:sense:01", "term": "它们", "text": "通常用于指称非人的多个事物。在明确指人且伴随动物化等贬损的语境中，可能有贬低或去人格化作用；不能仅凭代词形式认定目标或贬损性质。"}}
{"id": "definition:lex-0112:sense:01", "kind": "definition", "source": {"categories": ["LGBTQ"], "entry_id": "lex-0112", "lexicon_sha256": "31240193eeba29f712560e2e80e89ee9dd5c3c969aa180d10b95bf2451882385", "sense_id": "lex-0112:sense:01", "term": "基佬", "text": "'基'同粤语中'gay'的发音，对男同性恋群体的侮辱性表达。"}}
{"id": "definition:lex-0037:sense:01", "kind": "definition", "source": {"categories": ["Sexism"], "entry_id": "lex-0037", "lexicon_sha256": "31240193eeba29f712560e2e80e89ee9dd5c3c969aa180d10b95bf2451882385", "sense_id": "lex-0037:sense:01", "term": "幕刃", "text": "'幕刃'是'母人'的中文谐音，是对女性群体的侮辱性用词。"}}
{"id": "definition:lex-0068:sense:01", "kind": "definition", "source": {"categories": ["Sexism"], "entry_id": "lex-0068", "lexicon_sha256": "31240193eeba29f712560e2e80e89ee9dd5c3c969aa180d10b95bf2451882385", "sense_id": "lex-0068:sense:01", "term": "国男", "text": "“中国男性”的网络简称，在部分性别争论中带有概括、嘲讽或贬损意味；不等同于“中国男人”等普通完整表达中的任意两字片段，也不预设使用者的身份。"}}
{"id": "definition:lex-0104:sense:01", "kind": "definition", "source": {"categories": ["Sexism"], "entry_id": "lex-0104", "lexicon_sha256": "31240193eeba29f712560e2e80e89ee9dd5c3c969aa180d10b95bf2451882385", "sense_id": "lex-0104:sense:01", "term": "鸡", "text": "在部分粗俗语境中可借与“妓”的近音贬损女性或指称性工作者；应描述说话者的用法，不能把对女性的道德指控当作事实。“嫁鸡随鸡”等普通表达不套用该义项。"}}
{"id": "definition:lex-0108:sense:01", "kind": "definition", "source": {"categories": ["Sexism"], "entry_id": "lex-0108", "lexicon_sha256": "31240193eeba29f712560e2e80e89ee9dd5c3c969aa180d10b95bf2451882385", "sense_id": "lex-0108:sense:01", "term": "lkd", "text": "'lkd'是'烂裤裆'的首字母缩写，对一些私生活不检点甚至糜烂的女人的侮辱性表达。"}}
{"id": "definition:lex-0057:sense:01", "kind": "definition", "source": {"categories": ["Racism", "others"], "entry_id": "lex-0057", "lexicon_sha256": "31240193eeba29f712560e2e80e89ee9dd5c3c969aa180d10b95bf2451882385", "sense_id": "lex-0057:sense:01", "term": "黑子", "text": "网络用语，指针对现实或虚拟的人物、作品进行贬低、侮辱的群体，也常用于对黑人群体的侮辱性用词。"}}
{"id": "definition:lex-0111:sense:01", "kind": "definition", "source": {"categories": ["LGBTQ"], "entry_id": "lex-0111", "lexicon_sha256": "31240193eeba29f712560e2e80e89ee9dd5c3c969aa180d10b95bf2451882385", "sense_id": "lex-0111:sense:01", "term": "基", "text": "在部分网络或粤语相关表达中与 gay、男同性恋指称有关；“基本”“基因”等普通词里的“基”不属于这一用法。不能把对“基佬”整词的解释直接当成所有单字“基”的含义。"}}
{"id": "definition:lex-0182:sense:01", "kind": "definition", "source": {"categories": ["LGBTQ", "others"], "entry_id": "lex-0182", "lexicon_sha256": "31240193eeba29f712560e2e80e89ee9dd5c3c969aa180d10b95bf2451882385", "sense_id": "lex-0182:sense:01", "term": "染艾", "text": "'染艾'是'感染艾滋病'的中文缩写，常用于对男同性恋群体的侮辱性言论。"}}
{"id": "definition:lex-0235:sense:01", "kind": "definition", "source": {"categories": ["Sexism"], "entry_id": "lex-0235", "lexicon_sha256": "31240193eeba29f712560e2e80e89ee9dd5c3c969aa180d10b95bf2451882385", "sense_id": "lex-0235:sense:01", "term": "普信男", "text": "普通却自信的男人简称，常含贬义。"}}
{"id": "definition:lex-0279:sense:01", "kind": "definition", "source": {"categories": ["Sexism", "LGBTQ", "others"], "entry_id": "lex-0279", "lexicon_sha256": "31240193eeba29f712560e2e80e89ee9dd5c3c969aa180d10b95bf2451882385", "sense_id": "lex-0279:sense:01", "term": "娘娘腔", "text": "用于形容某些男性在语音、语调或行为上表现出的女性化特征，常含贬义。"}}
{"id": "definition:lex-0419:sense:01", "kind": "definition", "source": {"categories": ["Racism"], "entry_id": "lex-0419", "lexicon_sha256": "31240193eeba29f712560e2e80e89ee9dd5c3c969aa180d10b95bf2451882385", "sense_id": "lex-0419:sense:01", "term": "嘿嘿", "text": "'嘿嘿'是'黑黑'的中文谐音，对黑人群体的侮辱性称呼。"}}
{"id": "definition:lex-0455:sense:01", "kind": "definition", "source": {"categories": ["Sexism"], "entry_id": "lex-0455", "lexicon_sha256": "31240193eeba29f712560e2e80e89ee9dd5c3c969aa180d10b95bf2451882385", "sense_id": "lex-0455:sense:01", "term": "接盘侠", "text": "形容男人愿意接受女人复杂的情史、堕胎等行为，并愿意娶她为妻。"}}
{"id": "definition:lex-0543:sense:01", "kind": "definition", "source": {"categories": ["LGBTQ"], "entry_id": "lex-0543", "lexicon_sha256": "31240193eeba29f712560e2e80e89ee9dd5c3c969aa180d10b95bf2451882385", "sense_id": "lex-0543:sense:01", "term": "反同", "text": "反对同性恋，是指对同性恋持否定、排斥或敌视的态度和立场。"}}
{"id": "definition:lex-0545:sense:01", "kind": "definition", "source": {"categories": ["LGBTQ"], "entry_id": "lex-0545", "lexicon_sha256": "31240193eeba29f712560e2e80e89ee9dd5c3c969aa180d10b95bf2451882385", "sense_id": "lex-0545:sense:01", "term": "撑同", "text": "来源于2013年举办的反歧视活动'撑同志反歧视'，是'反同'的反义词。"}}
{"id": "definition:lex-0590:sense:01", "kind": "definition", "source": {"categories": ["others"], "entry_id": "lex-0590", "lexicon_sha256": "31240193eeba29f712560e2e80e89ee9dd5c3c969aa180d10b95bf2451882385", "sense_id": "lex-0590:sense:01", "term": "垃圾", "text": "形容一个人或事物毫无价值、无用或者令人反感。"}}
{"id": "definition:lex-0690:sense:01", "kind": "definition", "source": {"categories": ["others"], "entry_id": "lex-0690", "lexicon_sha256": "31240193eeba29f712560e2e80e89ee9dd5c3c969aa180d10b95bf2451882385", "sense_id": "lex-0690:sense:01", "term": "网暴", "text": "'网络暴力'的简称，指通过网络以文本、图像、音频、视频等形式对个人集中发布的，含有侮辱谩骂、造谣诽谤、煽动仇恨、威逼胁迫、侵犯隐私，以及影响身心健康的指责嘲讽、贬低歧视等内容的违法和不良信息。"}}
{"id": "definition:lex-0714:sense:01", "kind": "definition", "source": {"categories": ["others"], "entry_id": "lex-0714", "lexicon_sha256": "31240193eeba29f712560e2e80e89ee9dd5c3c969aa180d10b95bf2451882385", "sense_id": "lex-0714:sense:01", "term": "ex", "text": "'恶心'的中文拼音缩写，厌恶之极,不堪忍耐。"}}
{"id": "definition:lex-0731:sense:01", "kind": "definition", "source": {"categories": ["others"], "entry_id": "lex-0731", "lexicon_sha256": "31240193eeba29f712560e2e80e89ee9dd5c3c969aa180d10b95bf2451882385", "sense_id": "lex-0731:sense:01", "term": "双标", "text": "对同一性质的事件或人，因主观偏好、利益等因素采用不同评判标准的行为‌。"}}
{"id": "definition:lex-new-6b02c58315cc4cdf:sense:01", "kind": "definition", "source": {"categories": ["others"], "entry_id": "lex-new-6b02c58315cc4cdf", "lexicon_sha256": "31240193eeba29f712560e2e80e89ee9dd5c3c969aa180d10b95bf2451882385", "sense_id": "lex-new-6b02c58315cc4cdf:sense:01", "term": "乐色", "text": "“垃圾”的方言读音相关写法，可用于表示无价值、令人反感的事物或贬低对象；具体是物品、观点还是对人的贬损须结合上下文，不自动指定群体目标。"}}
{"id": "definition:lex-0031:sense:01", "kind": "definition", "source": {"categories": ["Sexism"], "entry_id": "lex-0031", "lexicon_sha256": "31240193eeba29f712560e2e80e89ee9dd5c3c969aa180d10b95bf2451882385", "sense_id": "lex-0031:sense:01", "term": "仙女", "text": "在某些情况下被用来指代那些自私自利、双标、让人厌恶的女性。"}}
{"id": "definition:lex-0032:sense:01", "kind": "definition", "source": {"categories": ["Sexism"], "entry_id": "lex-0032", "lexicon_sha256": "31240193eeba29f712560e2e80e89ee9dd5c3c969aa180d10b95bf2451882385", "sense_id": "lex-0032:sense:01", "term": "小仙女", "text": "在某些情况下被用来指代那些自私自利、双标、让人厌恶的女性。"}}
{"id": "definition:lex-0060:sense:01", "kind": "definition", "source": {"categories": ["Racism", "Region"], "entry_id": "lex-0060", "lexicon_sha256": "31240193eeba29f712560e2e80e89ee9dd5c3c969aa180d10b95bf2451882385", "sense_id": "lex-0060:sense:01", "term": "非洲佬", "text": "对黑人群体及非洲地区的侮辱性用词。"}}
{"id": "definition:lex-0067:sense:01", "kind": "definition", "source": {"categories": ["Sexism"], "entry_id": "lex-0067", "lexicon_sha256": "31240193eeba29f712560e2e80e89ee9dd5c3c969aa180d10b95bf2451882385", "sense_id": "lex-0067:sense:01", "term": "母人", "text": "是对女性群体的侮辱性用词。"}}
{"id": "definition:lex-0129:sense:01", "kind": "definition", "source": {"categories": ["Sexism", "others"], "entry_id": "lex-0129", "lexicon_sha256": "31240193eeba29f712560e2e80e89ee9dd5c3c969aa180d10b95bf2451882385", "sense_id": "lex-0129:sense:01", "term": "舔狗", "text": "指毫无尊严去跪舔他人的人，多指男性。"}}
{"id": "definition:lex-0135:sense:01", "kind": "definition", "source": {"categories": ["Racism"], "entry_id": "lex-0135", "lexicon_sha256": "31240193eeba29f712560e2e80e89ee9dd5c3c969aa180d10b95bf2451882385", "sense_id": "lex-0135:sense:01", "term": "白皮", "text": "对白人群体的侮辱性用词。"}}
{"id": "definition:lex-0286:sense:01", "kind": "definition", "source": {"categories": ["LGBTQ"], "entry_id": "lex-0286", "lexicon_sha256": "31240193eeba29f712560e2e80e89ee9dd5c3c969aa180d10b95bf2451882385", "sense_id": "lex-0286:sense:01", "term": "同志", "text": "在部分语境中用于指称同性恋者；普通同伴、同事或政治称谓等用法不应直接套用这一义项。"}}
{"id": "definition:lex-0310:sense:01", "kind": "definition", "source": {"categories": ["Racism"], "entry_id": "lex-0310", "lexicon_sha256": "31240193eeba29f712560e2e80e89ee9dd5c3c969aa180d10b95bf2451882385", "sense_id": "lex-0310:sense:01", "term": "黑皮", "text": "本意为黑色皮肤，常用于指代黑人群体，含贬义。"}}
{"id": "definition:lex-0335:sense:01", "kind": "definition", "source": {"categories": ["others"], "entry_id": "lex-0335", "lexicon_sha256": "31240193eeba29f712560e2e80e89ee9dd5c3c969aa180d10b95bf2451882385", "sense_id": "lex-0335:sense:01", "term": "反黑", "text": "在治安等语境中可指打击黑社会势力。"}}
{"id": "definition:lex-0335:sense:02", "kind": "definition", "source": {"categories": ["Racism"], "entry_id": "lex-0335", "lexicon_sha256": "31240193eeba29f712560e2e80e89ee9dd5c3c969aa180d10b95bf2451882385", "sense_id": "lex-0335:sense:02", "term": "反黑", "text": "在部分种族议题讨论中也可能指反对、排斥或敌视黑人；需依据具体语境区分，不能将所有“反黑”都解释为对黑人的迫害。"}}
{"id": "definition:lex-0343:sense:01", "kind": "definition", "source": {"categories": ["LGBTQ"], "entry_id": "lex-0343", "lexicon_sha256": "31240193eeba29f712560e2e80e89ee9dd5c3c969aa180d10b95bf2451882385", "sense_id": "lex-0343:sense:01", "term": "骗婚", "text": "同性恋者隐瞒自己性取向，步入异性恋婚姻的行为。"}}
{"id": "definition:lex-0437:sense:01", "kind": "definition", "source": {"categories": ["others"], "entry_id": "lex-0437", "lexicon_sha256": "31240193eeba29f712560e2e80e89ee9dd5c3c969aa180d10b95bf2451882385", "sense_id": "lex-0437:sense:01", "term": "圣母", "text": "意思是那些无原则底线的包容、原谅他人，对任何人事物都抱有博爱之心，不讲求客观事实，一切行动准则都只围绕“爱”“善”两字为中心，会因此伤害到他人的人。"}}
{"id": "definition:lex-0449:sense:01", "kind": "definition", "source": {"categories": ["Sexism"], "entry_id": "lex-0449", "lexicon_sha256": "31240193eeba29f712560e2e80e89ee9dd5c3c969aa180d10b95bf2451882385", "sense_id": "lex-0449:sense:01", "term": "阿娜", "text": "'阿娜'是游戏《魔兽世界：军团再临》中的游戏角色'鬼母阿娜'的简称，因其性别为女且形象丑陋，常用于对女性群体的侮辱性称呼，尤其是体型较大的女性群体。"}}
{"id": "definition:lex-0463:sense:01", "kind": "definition", "source": {"categories": ["others"], "entry_id": "lex-0463", "lexicon_sha256": "31240193eeba29f712560e2e80e89ee9dd5c3c969aa180d10b95bf2451882385", "sense_id": "lex-0463:sense:01", "term": "**", "text": "一般**是通配符号，可以替代所有的字符，常用于替换一些敏感或毒性用词。"}}
{"id": "definition:lex-0473:sense:01", "kind": "definition", "source": {"categories": ["Region"], "entry_id": "lex-0473", "lexicon_sha256": "31240193eeba29f712560e2e80e89ee9dd5c3c969aa180d10b95bf2451882385", "sense_id": "lex-0473:sense:01", "term": "爱丁堡", "text": "网络用语主要指的是中国城市上海。这一隐喻起源于2022年上海第六人民医院发布的一篇关于救治外籍患者特殊病例的文章，引发了公众对于医疗资源分配问题的讨论。"}}
{"id": "definition:lex-0562:sense:01", "kind": "definition", "source": {"categories": ["others"], "entry_id": "lex-0562", "lexicon_sha256": "31240193eeba29f712560e2e80e89ee9dd5c3c969aa180d10b95bf2451882385", "sense_id": "lex-0562:sense:01", "term": "魔怔", "text": "网络用语，指那些行为举止异常、情绪不稳定的现象，通常表现为对某些事物极度热爱，甚至产生戒断反应，失去这些事物后无法自拔。这种现象在网络上尤为常见，常常出现在社交网络骂战中。‌"}}
{"id": "definition:lex-0624:sense:01", "kind": "definition", "source": {"categories": ["Region"], "entry_id": "lex-0624", "lexicon_sha256": "31240193eeba29f712560e2e80e89ee9dd5c3c969aa180d10b95bf2451882385", "sense_id": "lex-0624:sense:01", "term": "九头鸟", "text": "来源于“天上九头鸟，地上湖北佬”的谚语，影射湖北人好战、不团结、精明等。"}}
{"id": "definition:lex-0635:sense:01", "kind": "definition", "source": {"categories": ["others"], "entry_id": "lex-0635", "lexicon_sha256": "31240193eeba29f712560e2e80e89ee9dd5c3c969aa180d10b95bf2451882385", "sense_id": "lex-0635:sense:01", "term": "操", "text": "在部分口语、网络粗口中用于咒骂或表达强烈不满，属粗俗表达；“操作”等普通词中的用法应排除。"}}
